  "text_md": "|（三）向社会发布网络安全风险预警，发布避免、减轻危害的措施。|\n|---|\n|第五十五条 发生网络安全事件，应当立即启动网络安全事件应急预案，对网络安|\n|全事件进行调查和评估，要求网络运营者采取技术措施和其他必要措施，消除安全隐患，|\n|防止危害扩大，并及时向社会发布与公众有关的警示信息。|\n|第五十六条 省级以上人民政府有关部门在履行网络安全监督管理职责中，发现网|\n|络存在较大安全风险或者发生安全事件的，可以按照规定的权限和程序对该网络的运营者|\n|的法定代表人或者主要负责人进行约谈。网络运营者应当按照要求采取措施，进行整改，|\n|消除隐患。|\n|第五十七条 因网络安全事件，发生突发事件或者生产安全事故的，应当依照《中|\n|华人民共和国突发事件应对法》、《中华人民共和国安全生产法》等有关法律、行政法规|\n|的规定处置。|\n|第五十八条 因维护国家安全和社会公共秩序，处置重大突发社会安全事件的需要，|\n|经国务院决定或者批准，可以在特定区域对网络通信采取限制等临时措施。|\n|第六章 法律责任|\n|第五十九条 网络运营者不履行本法第二十一条、第二十五条规定的网络安全保护|\n|义务的，由有关主管部门责令改正，给予警告；拒不改正或者导致危害网络安全等后果的，|\n|处一万元以上十万元以下罚款，对直接负责的主管人员处五千元以上五万元以下罚款。|\n|关键信息基础设施的运营者不履行本法第三十三条、第三十四条、第三十六条、第三|\n|十八条规定的网络安全保护义务的，由有关主管部门责令改正，给予警告；拒不改正或者|\n|导致危害网络安全等后果的，处十万元以上一百万元以下罚款，对直接负责的主管人员处|\n|一万元以上十万元以下罚款。|\n|第六十条 违反本法第二十二条第一款、第二款和第四十八条第一款规定，有下列|\n|行为之一的，由有关主管部门责令改正，给予警告；拒不改正或者导致危害网络安全等后|\n|果的，处五万元以上五十万元以下罚款，对直接负责的主管人员处一万元以上十万元以下|\n|罚款：|\n\nSource: [http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/xinwen/2016-11/07/content_2001605.htm](http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/xinwen/2016-11/07/content_2001605.htm) Accessed: 28-March_2018\n",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15694444943097682,
        "y0": 0.10167932992029671,
        "x1": 0.7451798432792713,
        "y1": 0.11683084507181185
      },
      "text": "（三）向社会发布网络安全风险预警，发布避免、减轻危害的措施。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.131982360223327,
        "x1": 0.25534314423604726,
        "y1": 0.14713387537484213
      },
      "text": "第五十五条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29016340168472987,
        "y0": 0.131982360223327,
        "x1": 0.881928063685598,
        "y1": 0.14713387537484213
      },
      "text": "发生网络安全事件，应当立即启动网络安全事件应急预案，对网络安",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.16231059064768782,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.17746210579920296
      },
      "text": "全事件进行调查和评估，要求网络运营者采取技术措施和其他必要措施，消除安全隐患，",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.1926136209507181,
        "x1": 0.6274918824239494,
        "y1": 0.20776513610223324
      },
      "text": "防止危害扩大，并及时向社会发布与公众有关的警示信息。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.22291665125374838,
        "x1": 0.2545588374917024,
        "y1": 0.23806816640526363
      },
      "text": "第五十六条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942483690049913,
        "y0": 0.22291665125374838,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.23806816640526363
      },
      "text": "省级以上人民政府有关部门在履行网络安全监督管理职责中，发现网",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.25325759733566133,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.26840911248717647
      },
      "text": "络存在较大安全风险或者发生安全事件的，可以按照规定的权限和程序对该网络的运营者",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.2835606276386916,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.29871214279020675
      },
      "text": "的法定代表人或者主要负责人进行约谈。网络运营者应当按照要求采取措施，进行整改，",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.3138636579417219,
        "x1": 0.21572711420994178,
        "y1": 0.329015173093237
      },
      "text": "消除隐患。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.3441919268983783,
        "x1": 0.2545588374917024,
        "y1": 0.35934344204989344
      },
      "text": "第五十七条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942483690049913,
        "y0": 0.3441919268983783,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.35934344204989344
      },
      "text": "因网络安全事件，发生突发事件或者生产安全事故的，应当依照《中",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.3744949572014086,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.3896464723529238
      },
      "text": "华人民共和国突发事件应对法》、《中华人民共和国安全生产法》等有关法律、行政法规",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.40479798750443896,
        "x1": 0.23533498227985855,
        "y1": 0.4199495026559541
      },
      "text": "的规定处置。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.43510101780746924,
        "x1": 0.2545588374917024,
        "y1": 0.4502525329589844
      },
      "text": "第五十八条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2746405258677364,
        "y0": 0.43510101780746924,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.4502525329589844
      },
      "text": "因维护国家安全和社会公共秩序，处置重大突发社会安全事件的需要，",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.46542928676412565,
        "x1": 0.7649183210983775,
        "y1": 0.4805808019156408
      },
      "text": "经国务院决定或者批准，可以在特定区域对网络通信采取限制等临时措施。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.42418301650901247,
        "y0": 0.4957323170671559,
        "x1": 0.4830065459207772,
        "y1": 0.5108838322186711
      },
      "text": "第六章",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4973529491549224,
        "y0": 0.4957323170671559,
        "x1": 0.575784321703942,
        "y1": 0.5108838322186711
      },
      "text": "法律责任",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.5260353473701862,
        "x1": 0.25534314423604726,
        "y1": 0.5411868625217013
      },
      "text": "第五十九条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29016340168472987,
        "y0": 0.5260353473701862,
        "x1": 0.881928063685598,
        "y1": 0.5411868625217013
      },
      "text": "网络运营者不履行本法第二十一条、第二十五条规定的网络安全保护",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.5563762549198035,
        "x1": 0.902001686345518,
        "y1": 0.5715277700713186
      },
      "text": "义务的，由有关主管部门责令改正，给予警告；拒不改正或者导致危害网络安全等后果的，",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.5866792852228337,
        "x1": 0.8627860000710083,
        "y1": 0.6018308003743489
      },
      "text": "处一万元以上十万元以下罚款，对直接负责的主管人员处五千元以上五万元以下罚款。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.6169823155258641,
        "x1": 0.8820098926818448,
        "y1": 0.6321338306773793
      },
      "text": "关键信息基础设施的运营者不履行本法第三十三条、第三十四条、第三十六条、第三",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.6473106230148161,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.6624621381663313
      },
      "text": "十八条规定的网络安全保护义务的，由有关主管部门责令改正，给予警告；拒不改正或者",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.6776136340516986,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.6927651492032139
      },
      "text": "导致危害网络安全等后果的，处十万元以上一百万元以下罚款，对直接负责的主管人员处",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.707916664354729,
        "x1": 0.37258992163963567,
        "y1": 0.7230681795062441
      },
      "text": "一万元以上十万元以下罚款。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.7382323139845723,
        "x1": 0.23534313526028902,
        "y1": 0.7533838291360875
      },
      "text": "第六十条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27014706181544884,
        "y0": 0.7382323139845723,
        "x1": 0.8819118075900607,
        "y1": 0.7533838291360875
      },
      "text": "违反本法第二十二条第一款、第二款和第四十八条第一款规定，有下列",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.7685606022073765,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.7837121173588917
      },
      "text": "行为之一的，由有关主管部门责令改正，给予警告；拒不改正或者导致危害网络安全等后",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.7988636325104068,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.814015147661922
      },
      "text": "果的，处五万元以上五十万元以下罚款，对直接负责的主管人员处一万元以上十万元以下",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.8291666628134371,
        "x1": 0.17651145286809386,
        "y1": 0.8443181779649522
      },
      "text": "罚款：",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.8771780283764156,
        "x1": 0.8664126053355099,
        "y1": 0.8954861091844963
      },
      "text": "Source: http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/xinwen/2016-11/07/content_2001605.htm",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
